=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_f3b9 — Dog Dinner: Bag to Floor at Seven

The dog_food_bag_shared sits on the pantry shelf during the day (18:00 pass confirms pantry_shelf_k1) but is on the kitchen floor by 20:00 and remains there at 22:00. Yuki looks after the dog, and the 18:00–20:00 gap is when she would feed the dog's evening meal: she takes the bag from the pantry, pours kibble into the dog bowl on the kitchen floor, and leaves the bag on the floor for the rest of the evening (or the next day). The dog_bowl_shared is already on the kitchen floor (its usual resting spot per the per-object evidence), so the feeding is a simple "bring bag to floor, pour, set bag down" routine.

This document sets itself apart by placing the bag on the floor from 19:00 onward on weekdays (not just at the 20:00 pass). It predicts the bag will be on the kitchen floor, not the pantry shelf, at 19:00, 21:00, and 22:00.

Refutation: if the bag is back on the pantry shelf by 21:00 or 22:00, the "stays on floor" prediction fails. If it is still on the pantry shelf at 19:00, the feeding happens later than 19:00.

